---
title: Small Business Services FAQ | Thomas Web Group
description: Answers about website design, social media management, CRM and HubSpot support, ongoing services, and working with Thomas Web Group.
layout: 'base.njk'
permalink: /faq/
---

<main class="main">
  <section id="faq" class="portfolio-details section">
    <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <div><span>Websites, Social Media,</span> <span class="description-title">CRM Support</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <div class="portfolio-details-content">
            <div class="project-overview">
              <h1>Questions About Working With Us</h1>
              <div class="accordion project-accordion" id="fullFaq">
          {% set questions = [
            ['What services do you offer?', 'We help with website design, social media management, CRM and business systems, and growth strategy and automation.'],
            ['Can you help with an existing website?', 'Yes. We can improve an existing site or plan a redesign, and can also provide hosting and ongoing website care.'],
            ['Which social media platforms do you support?', 'Facebook is our primary focus. We also support Instagram and LinkedIn.'],
            ['Can you help with my current CRM?', 'Yes. We can set up or improve HubSpot and other existing CRM systems, and help organize lead tracking and follow-up.'],
            ['Do you provide ongoing support?', 'Yes. Monthly support can cover website maintenance, social media posting, CRM administration, and automation checks. We agree on the tasks first.'],
            ['How does pricing work?', 'We do not publish fixed prices. Cost depends on the work involved; we outline scope and cost before work starts.'],
            ['Do you work outside East Tennessee?', 'Yes. East Tennessee is our local market, and we also work with businesses nationwide.'],
            ['What happens after I get in touch?', 'We read your message and email you to clarify what you need and arrange a call.']
          ] %}
          {% for item in questions %}
          <div class="accordion-item" data-aos="fade-up">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="full-faq-heading-{{ loop.index }}"><button class="accordion-button {% if not loop.first %}collapsed{% endif %}" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#full-faq-{{ loop.index }}" aria-expanded="{{ 'true' if loop.first else 'false' }}" aria-controls="full-faq-{{ loop.index }}"><i class="bi bi-question-circle me-2"></i>{{ item[0] }}</button></h2>
            <div id="full-faq-{{ loop.index }}" class="accordion-collapse collapse {% if loop.first %}show{% endif %}" data-bs-parent="#fullFaq"><div class="accordion-body"><p>{{ item[1] }}</p></div></div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
              </div>
              <div class="text-center mt-5"><h2>Have a question about your project?</h2><a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Let's Talk</a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
